Subject: Cantor SJS Staged Diff Acquisition P1 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] b8059134-f2eb-4d5e-81b6-a3b2af2fdcd1
@ [canonical_uuid] 8fd08ecd-72ba-495c-b172-e91d554a8224

& [Why]
  + P0 cannot prove an inventory corresponds to Git because physical observation is intentionally absent
  + exact read-only acquisition is the smallest next bridge toward mechanically attributed commits
  + pinning executable repository index and identities prevents ambient Git behavior from becoming silent authority

& [WhyNotBroader]
  + staging publication hooks and change-set self-reference require distinct policies and risks
  + provider update-broker and autonomous-agent authority are unrelated and remain excluded
